{"case_id": "m11", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "anthropic__claude-sonnet-5.5@low", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5", "effort": "low", "group": "claude", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Common Fractions"], "output": "**Step 1:** Find a common denominator. The LCD of 4 and 3 is 12.\n\n**Step 2:** Convert each fraction.\n3/4 = 9/12\n2/3 = 8/12\n\n**Step 3:** Add the numerators.\n9/12 + 8/12 = 17/12\n\n**Step 4:** Convert to a mixed number.\n17 ÷ 12 = 1 remainder 5\n\n**Answer: 1 5/12**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.719, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 710, "output_tokens": 150, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.00292, "served_models": ["anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5"], "hosts": ["Claude Platform on AWS"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:04:33"}
{"case_id": "m07", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "anthropic__claude-sonnet-5.5@low", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5", "effort": "low", "group": "claude", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Exponents"], "output": "**Solution**\n\n2³ × 2² = 2^(3+2) (same base, add the exponents)\n= 2⁵\n= 32\n\n**Check:** 2³ = 8 and 2² = 4, so 8 × 4 = 32 ✓\n\n**Answer: 32**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.745, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 606, "output_tokens": 91, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.002122, "served_models": ["anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5"], "hosts": ["Claude Platform on AWS"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:04:33"}
